  {
   "title": "the Party Rooms",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Each room had a dedicated theme relating to top TikTok trends which informed the decor and interactivity within each space. Featured rooms included <strong>Area 51</strong>, <strong>Clown Town</strong>, <strong>Distortion Zone,</strong> and <strong>Zombie VSCO Girl</strong>. The entire property was converted into a thrilling Halloween environment accented with projection mapping and billowing fog. Guests were treated to live performances from <strong>Supa Dupa Humble</strong>, <strong>Sueco the Child</strong>, <strong>Stunna Girl</strong>, <strong>Jasiah</strong>, and <strong>YBN Nahmir</strong>.</p>"
    },
